#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="docs/**"

PURPOSE:
Rules active when touching documentation files. Loaded on demand — not every session.
Fill in for your project. Delete sections that don't apply.

---

AUDIENCE:
; Who reads these docs? Engineers, end users, stakeholders?
; e.g., "docs/ is human-facing reference for engineers. No AI continuity content here."
- (fill in)

FORMAT_CONVENTIONS:
; e.g., "markdown only; no HTML in doc files"
; e.g., "all docs use sentence case headings, not title case"
- (fill in)

DOC_OWNERSHIP:
; Which files are AI-maintained vs human-maintained?
; e.g., "docs/roadmap.md is human-owned — AI appends but does not rewrite"
; e.g., "docs/api-reference.md is AI-generated from source annotations"
- (fill in)
